     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div>Hi All,</div><div><br></div><div>This is just to confirm that rworldmap 1.3-1 has been up on CRAN for a week or so.</div><div>I&#39;d recommend updating ( install.packages(&quot;rworldmap&quot;) ).</div><div><br></div><div>Main changes from the previous CRAN version are :</div><div>~ cleaner imports (loading should be quicker)</div><div>~ <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">French Guiana separated from France</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">~ Western Sahara codes corrected</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">~ improved country to grid conversions</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">~ </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">mapPies() fixed xlim ylim</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">~ </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">Added line width option (lwd) for country boundaries in maps</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">More details here :</span></div><div><a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/rworldmap/ChangeLog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/rworldmap/ChangeLog&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494926287000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2W4JGjE7i1ktZUve5TZF7P\">http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/rworldmap/ChangeLog</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">I plan to get some more development in over the next month and will keep you posted.</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">Happy mapping,</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">Andy</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></div><div><br></div></div>"
